Package: UKBfunctions
Title: Utilities for Processing and Analysing UK Biobank Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jure", "Mur", , "jure.mur@uni.lu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides utilities for processing and analysing UK Biobank
    (UKB) data for multimorbidity research and predictive modelling.
    Includes functions for disease ascertainment from self-report and
    inpatient data, feature engineering of auxiliary variables, stratified
    train/test splitting with optional imputation, class imbalance
    correction, and model training via 'caret'.
